{"kind":"autopsy.EQ14_B3","experiment":"E-Q14","fired_floor":"B3 (zero-pollution cleanliness): pollution fraction == 0 at nPoll=0 — FALSIFIED (observed ~0.94 median)","false_assumption":"B3 encoded the assumption that pair slots are PRIVATE under zero pollution. The run falsified it.","mechanism":"(1) instrumentation verified correct: at t=1 all 8 pair events are PARTNER events (the sequential slot+resonance provenance matching works). (2) the 16 members form a CLIMBING CONVOY on adjacent d-tracks — planting assigns consecutive d 8..15, members climb ~1/tick with a one-tick role phase offset (row-major later member hears the same-tick write and climbs first), so cross-pair slot sharing begins at t=2 and partner events decay 6/tick -> 1/tick as the convoy compresses. (3) from t~55 ALL members saturate at d=63: slot 63 becomes a permanent shared party line; partner events = 0 for the remainder of the run (E-Q1 finalsMin=finalsMax=63 corroborates). (4) consequence: the wormhole table is CONTENT-addressed, not identity-addressed — any occupant with resonance != 0 fires the reader.","boundary_map_entry":"DELIVERY is congestion-ROBUST (B2 held: 80/80 pair-trials delivered 8/8 at 256 polluters; any positive term delivers). PROVENANCE is congestion-FRAGILE (zero-pollution pollution fraction 0.94 from convoy compression + saturation rail). Downstream rule: if a consumer needs WHO, d must be assigned with separation margins and drift control (64 slots, 16 members at +-1/tick WILL collide); if a consumer needs only SIGNAL, congestion is harmless.","probe_artifact":"experiments/e_q14_b3_autopsy.mjs","probe_sha256":"a3a7119501c23aaa3c12cfa33d87d19760a35069d9eafcf30ba314a838c4041f","honest_status":"B3 FAIL stands; the finding upgrades the boundary map; no floor was edited post-run","row_hash":"6a7a2118da79ef038cbd0d8a319d15108ce64238cd7a3849febc010994b03a56"}
